+## Technical report & citation
+
+A four-page technical report describing the datapath, the 32,026,992-check differential
+verification and the legacy post-mortem is in [`docs/technical-report.pdf`](docs/technical-report.pdf).
+Releases are archived on Zenodo; cite via the "Cite this repository" button (from `CITATION.cff`) or:
+
+```
+Amouzadeh, S. (2026). Floating-Point-ALU: a bit-exact C++17 software model of an IEEE 754 binary32 ALU
+(Version 1.0.0) [Computer software]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX
+```
+
+---
